# Consumer .npmrc for @cypherx/chat-ui (private registry).
# Copy to `.npmrc` in the consuming project (fde-console / a client app) and
# provide NPM_TOKEN via the environment / a build secret — never commit a token.
#
# npm private registry (default):
@cypherx:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
#
# Self-hosted Verdaccio — use these two lines instead:
# @cypherx:registry=https://npm.internal.cypherx.ai/
# //npm.internal.cypherx.ai/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
